<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 287-d t-bill auction for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 287-d t-bill auction for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank said the treasury would auction on Tuesday 287-day bills after a 399-day auction on January 21.</p>
<p>Maturity: November 19, 1997</p>
<p>Amount: -</p>
<p>Coupon: -</p>
<p>Auction date: February 4, 1997</p>
<p>Value date: February 5, 1997</p>
<p>-- Istanbul Newsroom +90-212-275 0875</p>
